  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistical system, ph. 3 - Statistical system ph. 3</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Statistikprojekt, fas 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta projekt &#xE4;r en forts&#xE4;ttning p&#xE5; ett sedan 1995 p&#xE5;g&#xE5;ende samarbete mellan den ukrainska statistikmyndigheten och Statistics Sweden (SCB). Insatsen inneb&#xE4;r fortsatt st&#xF6;d till omstruktureringen av statistiksystemet i Ukraina. Insatsen genomf&#xF6;rs genom studiebes&#xF6;ks- seminarie- och utbildningsverksamhet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The cooperation between Ukraine and Sweden (SCB) in the field of statistics was iniciated in 1995. The support is aiming to strengthen the reform within the statistical system in Ukraine, through transfer og know-how, seminars and stydy visits.</narrative>
  </description>
